# rm526, the graft that took (Docs/Design/84). Exported from ridgemere3 at revision 1: edit it in Atlas or the DM, or as a draft through tools/mantle_load.py.
mantle rm526
revision 1
state ready
dialect plain
accent none
tier full
written_for rm_isolde_fell_
written_by codex
title the graft that took
fits stage=adult|old
prefers job=noble
traits temper=even talk=plain warmth=reserved humour=none honesty=plain piety=ordinary drive=steady
quirk presses_a_thumb_to_the_graft_tie
likes fried_fish digging fresh_straw warm_rain
dislikes salt_wind drizzle
fears a_root_drowned_in_salt
hopes a_house_strong_enough_for_another_winter
topics work +0.7 land +0.5 family +0.3 prices +0.3
styles comfort=practical gossip=plain refuse=cold tease=none
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# tests a visitor's usefulness by offering a small definite task, cuts old graft ties loose with care, and keeps a salt-stiff fragment of cord beneath the garden weights.

words
oath! = Sour the rootstock | Salt in the furrow
saying! = Show me where it took | A living branch pays in fruit
scion = a short green scion | a young fruit shoot
graftcord = a soft tying cord | a length of worn tape
brinecord = a salt-stiff strand | a length of crusted line
rowpeg = a plain row peg | a square garden peg
budscale = a reddish bud scale | a dry little husk
leafpress = a flat shale weight | a thin piece of slate
fishturn = a browned fish edge | a crisp curl of fish
patbutter = a little curl of butter | a shaving of pale butter
wetearth = a clot of black soil | a damp earth crumb
strawbase = a bed of sound straw | a strip of golden straw
sourfruit = a hard little windfall | an unripe knot of fruit
berryvat = an open fruit vat | a broad mash tub
dibbled = a short planting stick | a plain wooden dibble
stemline = a narrow join | a faint seam in the bark

grown
opinion @1 houses for 2 : A House earns its holdings by sustaining them through a change of season. A grand name will not preserve even a cask.
opinion @1 merchants mixed 1 : I am civil to merchants with sound goods. The degree of my civility has never altered the weight I require.
opinion @1 dole against 1 : I would have a kitchen give me its exact number of portions before it asks for another vat of fruit.
opinion @1 city for 1 : There is soil above the streets where roots will live. I have my reasons for keeping my interests on land.
opinion @1 road for 1 : A cart of ripe fruit makes the value of a sound road plain within an hour.
opinion @1 newcomers mixed 1 : A stranger who handles a valuable shoot with care has already supplied one satisfactory introduction.
opinion @1 church mixed 1 : I value a place to give silence its due. A great many public occasions make no provision for it.
opinion @1 watch mixed 1 : What matters to me is whether a loaded wagon can arrive intact. Reassurance is easily obtained elsewhere.
line @1 greet : State what you bring and where it can be put to use.
line @2 greet [pair.band=strangers] : I'll allow time enough to unwrap a sound sample.
line @1 greet.return : I recall precisely which part remained to be tested.
line @3 greet [here.time=dawn] : Use the morning while the ground is still easy to read.
line @1 farewell : You may leave the sample and take your leave.
line @1 farewell.return : The next meeting can begin with the result.
line @1 ask.how : Has today provided anything worth setting by?
line @1 answer.how : Busy, and satisfied with most of what I decided today.
line @1 thank : That was useful. I do not employ the word lightly.
line @1 deflect_thanks : A good return in due season will answer.
line @1 decline : I cannot grant terms which would be a burden on the root.
line @1 accept_decline : Good. A clear refusal can be entered and set aside.
line @1 sympathise : There is no deadline for what has no satisfactory answer.
line @1 reassure : Begin with the single thing your hand can actually reach.
line @1 react.news : Name the source and give me the sound portion.
line @1 react.news.new : I will have a separate place made for that cutting.
line @1 react.news.known : That information already has a date against it.
line @1 react.news.doubt : I'd test the join before committing a season to that stock.
line @1 react.news.glad [topic.kind=birth|marriage|work|apprentice|succession] : A sound result. Let the credit fall precisely where the work was done.
line @1 react.news.sorrow [topic.kind=death|loss|theft|assault|arrest|crime] : Bring the living something needed. Leave the manner of grief to those concerned.
line @1 ack : Understood. That part will bear weight.
line @1 again.open : Resume with the part that required a second hearing.
line @1 preclose : We have reached the point where further talk needs a result.
line @1 accept_preclose : Go and see how the thing fares in actual soil.
line @1 tell.self : I retain a name most easily after someone has done a useful piece of work.
line @2 greet.return [pair.band=friends|family] : You need not present your credentials again. Sit here.
line @2 decline [pair.disposition=hostile] : You have used your time to confirm my original refusal.
line @2 ask.how [pair.band=friends|family] : What would you choose to salvage from this particular day?
line @2 farewell [here.time=dusk] : Leave the garden ties loose enough to survive the night.
line @2 answer.how [here.time=night] : There are still matters I would rather inspect by daylight.
line @2 reassure [here.time=dawn] : Even a bare branch can be given one full morning.
scene work_1
when topic=work self.job=noble
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : #self.trade_words.capitalize#, and that means I inspect the fruit before anyone brings the painted label.
b : Even with a good vintage? | Why keep the label?
a : Especially then. A distinguished year ought to bear examination. | To name the contents after I am satisfied. It can perform that service admirably.

scene land_1
when topic=land
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A graft can live under #graftcord# and still be slowly strangled by its own success.
b : When do you remove the tie? | How can success strangle it?
a : When the join looks firm and I can feel the tape beginning to bite. | A growing branch takes more room. A tie doesn't grow just because I chose it carefully in spring.

scene prices_1
when topic=prices
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : There is a small locked place for uncollected debts. Every slip there carries a meaning I remember exactly.
b : Does age diminish a debt? | Will an eloquent appeal help?
a : It may diminish the paper. The undertaking has no such convenient frailty. | I would find an actual proposal more eloquent than an hour of excellent pleading.

scene family_1
when topic=family self.parent=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I would show #self.child# the least promising row as well as the best cask.
b : Why begin with a poor row? | Is it a lesson in thrift?
a : An heir can admire a success without instruction. Knowing when to cease expenditure is harder. | It's a lesson in looking. The saving follows an accurate judgement of what's there.

scene weather_1
when topic=weather self.dislikes=salt_wind
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A salt wind leaves a stiffness in cord that a warm shower won't immediately remove.
b : Do you throw the cord out? | Does the smell trouble you?
a : I put the stiff bit aside. I have one such strand I no longer use to bind anything living. | Yes. There are entire journeys a little salt can bring back without my consent.

scene work_2
when topic=work self.trade_words
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : In #self.workplace# I like a visitor to take on a small definite task before recommending an expensive one.
b : What sort of task? | Must the trial involve a garden?
a : Sort the sound windfalls from the bruised ones and explain any doubtful choice. | No. Anything with a result I can examine without reference to the speaker's own opinion.

scene food_1
when topic=food self.likes=fried_fish
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Fish in butter should reach me with the browned edge still making a faint noise.
b : Would you stop the talk to eat? | What about a sauce?
a : I would. The fish will deteriorate. The talk may improve from being given a minute's thought. | Let it have its own dish. Somebody has taken trouble over that crisp edge.

scene pastimes_1
when topic=pastimes self.likes=digging
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Digging makes no allowance for a title. The earth responds to actual pressure.
b : Would you dig in good clothes? | How far down do you go?
a : I change my shoes. I see no point in asking a costly pair to prove the principle twice. | Until I can examine the soil in which I expect the tree to live.

scene home_1
when topic=home self.likes=fresh_straw
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Fresh straw underfoot reports what came in on the last pair of shoes.
b : Is that straw's chief merit? | Why replace it if it is still dry?
a : I also like the clean smell. I needn't find a use in business for every preference. | I would shake the sound lengths free. Waste is no mark of a well-kept house.

scene weather_2
when topic=weather self.likes=warm_rain
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Rain arriving warm after a dry interval is worth more to my fruit rows than any visiting compliment.
b : Do you let it puddle? | At what point will it suffice?
a : No. Roots require water and air. A compliment will at least leave them air. | I dig below the top crust. A moist surface can give an excellent impression of a wet bed.

scene day_1
when topic=day
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I keep a shred of old cord beneath a slate. It has no remaining value to any business of mine.
b : Why keep something worthless? | May I see it?
a : I specified its business value. Even my ledgers admit the possibility of more than one column. | I prefer to leave that weight in place. There are other examples of salt damage in any yard.

scene friends_1
when topic=friends
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I can change my judgement of a visitor when I see a difficult thing done well.
b : Do you announce the change? | What would the visitor notice?
a : I ask a more important question and give the answer my entire attention. | A chair drawn closer and a piece of the actual work instead of a demonstration.

scene health_1
when topic=health
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Earth beneath a nail gives an hour of uncomfortable evidence that I neglected my hands.
b : Would a glove do? | Why use your fingers?
a : A glove is useful, but I want the particular feel of the soil before I decide what it can carry. | A clod can look heavy and fall quite pleasantly to crumbs under very slight pressure.

scene travel_1
when topic=travel
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I establish the expense of sending a barrel by land even when the sea passage appears cheaper.
b : Is that distrust of the ships? | What cost is never quoted?
a : It is knowledge of what a house can lose in one unlucky journey along a coast. | The one that keeps going after the goods have been written out of the stock account.

scene memories_1
when topic=memories self.house
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A wine barge can disappear and leave a reckoning that outlasts an entire cellar of wine.
b : Have you seen that happen? | Can a reckoning be finished?
a : I came into the weight of a House after such a loss. I decline to retell the circumstances for an audience. | Some can. A figure settled in the books needn't dispose of everything else.

scene times_1
when topic=times world.times=lean|hard
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : When a season is hard I look first at the stock that still has growing time before it.
b : Wouldn't ripe goods be worth more? | Do you save every weak shoot?
a : They are worth attending to today. An empty row in the coming year concerns me equally. | No. A struggling but viable shoot merits a chance. A dead one should cease consuming the labour due to living things.

scene gossip_1
when topic=gossip here.gossip=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : What came to me was that #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. No mark of origin accompanied the account.
b : Would you let it travel further? | Can an unmarked account be true?
a : With its lack of origin made quite plain. I won't lend my mark to somebody else's assertion. | Of course. Truth and commercial presentation have never been identical things.

scene news_1
when topic=news world.news
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The report for this sitting is #world.news#.
b : Does that satisfy you? | Will the report be kept?
a : It informs me. Satisfaction depends on the nature of the outcome and the use I can make of it. | With the date and the identity of the supplier, so far as the latter is known.

scene faith_1
when topic=faith
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I am willing to recognise that a life can end in circumstances no competence could have prevented.
b : Does that offer comfort? | How would you frame a prayer?
a : Little. Recognition is still preferable to blaming the dead for the weather. | That I retain the strength to do the next necessary thing when no answer is forthcoming.

scene newcomer_1
when topic=newcomer
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : An unfamiliar name above a cask presents no difficulty. The contents are open to ordinary examination.
b : Would you give the grower a chance? | How long does a name take to earn value?
a : A sound cask presented at the agreed time would be an excellent beginning. | Longer than is required to damage it by sending a poor lot under an attractive label.

scene festival_1
when topic=festival
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : For a feast I'd send fruit that can be eaten while standing.
b : Why such an ordinary choice? | Would you send the best pieces?
a : Consider a full street and then consider a dish requiring two hands and an elaborate spoon. | Fruit sufficiently ripe to give a good account of the tree. I see little value in a public sample nobody enjoys.

scene prices_2
when topic=prices
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A promise made in a rich year can come due during a year of empty presses.
b : Would you take a smaller return? | Why remember the rich year?
a : Bring me a precise alternative. I will consider an offer and give it far more consideration than vague pleading. | Because it is when the borrower judged the promise easy. I have an inconvenient memory for both occasions.

scene land_2
when topic=land
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I put #rowpeg# beside an uncertain plant before anyone is permitted to clear the row.
b : Does a peg grant an extra season? | Who's the peg meant for?
a : It grants another inspection. The plant must provide its own argument for the season. | Me, chiefly. A hurried hand can be every bit as destructive when it belongs to the owner.

scene animals_1
when topic=animals
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The first bird to take a ripe berry conducts an accurate test and presents no account of the result.
b : Do you begrudge the berry? | How would you obtain the result?
a : A berry, no. A flock attempting to set the terms of harvest is a rather different proposition. | Look for the empty stalk, then try the neighbouring fruit myself.

scene smalltalk_1
when topic=smalltalk
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I do not object to silence while a proposal is being considered.
b : Will you say if the proposal fails? | Could silence imply agreement?
a : Plainly. I would not have a visitor invest labour on the strength of my courtesy. | It should imply that I am considering what I heard. My agreement is available in perfectly ordinary words.

scene weather_3
when topic=weather self.dislikes=drizzle
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Drizzle can lay a handsome shine on a fruit and leave the roots quite dry.
b : Would a heavier rain help? | Can you feel the difference?
a : If it penetrates without washing the soil away. I ask rather more from rain than polished appearances. | Turn a little earth beside the row. The surface will cease trying to sell itself.

scene home_2
when topic=home
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A pot of butter and a handful of cut fruit belong on different shelves.
b : Is there a particular rule? | What if the fruit is covered?
a : Only that I prefer supper to taste of what I requested. Cut fruit can lend a smell without permission. | Then the arrangement matters less, although I should still wish my shelves to be orderly.

scene day_2
when topic=day here.time=dusk
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I leave a working garment where it can be distinguished from a good one without lighting a lamp.
b : Can your fingers recognise the cloth? | Why bother about the dark?
a : One cuff has caught on a pear branch more than once. I can find the roughness without looking. | I like getting into the garden early without requiring a household to rise and assist me.

story join [topic=land]
  : I tied a promising graft with a ribbon so handsome that I left it in place longer than the tree required.
  : The scar was a perfect narrow ring.
  b : Did the branch live?
  : Yes, after I took the ribbon off. I keep no fine ribbon in the garden basket now.

story skate [topic=food]
  : I put my freshly fried fish on a dish with too generous a pool of butter and started across the room.
  : The first step moved the fish some distance towards the edge.
  b : Did it reach the floor?
  : No. I steadied the dish and ate it where I stood. A dish can cease to travel without spoiling the meal.

story saltstrand [topic=memories]
  : I brought a length of ordinary garden cord to the coast and left it across a sill overnight.
  : In the morning it held the bend of the wood even after I lifted it.
  b : What made you remember that?
  : A strand that has been to sea will often hold the shape of a loss.

story redpigment [topic=work]
  : A wine sample left a rich red ring on a clean plank. I brought a small cup of water to examine the spread of the stain.
  : The water made a ring larger and paler than the first.
  b : Did you learn the depth?
  : Only after turning the plank on edge. Magnifying a mark is an unreliable way of learning how deep it runs.

story strawjudge [topic=home]
  : I asked for clean straw and received a bundle tied with a splendid knot. On the outside every stalk was bright.
  : One solitary damp stalk had worked loose from the middle.
  b : Did you accept the bundle?
  : I untied the knot. A seller can be proud of the correct tightness and still owe me a bundle that is sound in the middle.

rule @cord
when concept=bark
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Slack at the join. A shoot needs space to live. | Keep the old salt cord outside the basket.

rule @soil
when concept=bark self.likes=digging
does aside
cooldown 8h
say One thumb beneath the crust before judging the row. | Good soil breaks cleanly in a patient hand.

rule @butter
when concept=bark self.likes=fried_fish
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Let the crisp edge reach the dish intact. | Butter should accompany the fish without floating it.

rule @straw
when concept=bark self.likes=fresh_straw
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Shake out the sound straw before spending on a new bundle. | A dry length is still fit for service.

rule @dusk
when concept=bark here.time=dusk
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Set the work cuffs towards the door. | The morning garden owes no one an announcement.

rule @rain
when concept=bark self.likes=warm_rain
does aside
cooldown 8h
say A warm rain can earn its welcome underground. | Test the root bed when it has passed.

dlg @1 resident.hub : A definite proposal will receive a definite hearing.
dlg @1 resident.job [self.job=noble] : I direct the affairs of #self.workplace#. The successful applicant will show what can be accomplished with the resources at hand.
dlg @2 resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #topic.player#, your name requires no further explanation.
dlg @1 resident.news [world.news] : This report arrived for my consideration. #world.news#.
dlg @1 resident.gossip [here.gossip=yes] : There is a claim that #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. It carries no warranty from this table.
dlg @1 resident.quirk : I press a graft tie with my thumb before I trust my eyes as to the state of the join.
dlg @1 resident.how [tired=yes] : Weary enough to insist that the next visitor bring the short account.
dlg @1 resident.bye : When you return, bring the result you can verify.
dlg @3 resident.hub [pair.disposition=hostile] : I can recognise a grievance dressed up as a proposition. Put it plainly.
dlg @4 resident.hub [pair.band=friends|family] : You have earned a chair beside the useful work. Come nearer.
dlg @2 resident.bye [here.time=dusk] : I am keeping the final daylight for a brief inspection outside.
dlg @5 resident.hub [here.time=dawn] : The earth is still soft enough for a good test. What have you brought?
graft resident.hub
choice How do you decide if a visitor is useful? -> scion_sort
node scion_sort
say Give the visitor a small task where it is possible to do a little actual harm. Sorting fruit is a reasonable example. The fruit will keep the score.
choice How would a fine answer impress you? -> scion_return
choice I'll consider the doubtful pieces. -> hub
node scion_return
say I would inspect the two baskets. A useful answer draws attention to a doubtful piece I would have missed myself.
choice I'll consider the doubtful pieces. -> hub

graft resident.job
choice Do you really remember every old obligation? -> scion_debt
node scion_debt
say The original circumstances, the thing promised and the date agreed. There is little merit in merely remembering that I was once displeased.
choice Can an old debt ever cease to matter? -> scion_settled
choice I understand the distinction. -> job
node scion_settled
say When it is paid it ceases to be a debt. That is a considerable change in its standing and one I take equal trouble to remember.
choice I understand the distinction. -> job
